OL,3,GNEWSAShoreham sea deaths shock town's
OL,4,Aclose-knit community
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a 14-year-old girl and her parents
OL,7,Fdied after getting into difficulty in
OL,8,Fthe water off the coast of
OL,9,FShoreham-by-Sea, residents told the BBC
OL,10,Fthey were "devastated" and could not
OL,11,Fbelieve what had happened.
OL,13,FOne woman described the event as
OL,14,F"horrifying". Another said the
OL,15,Fcommunity was "in mourning" for Sara
OL,16,FEl-Khawas and her parents - husband and
OL,17,Fwife Hassan El-Khawas, 55, and Zeina
OL,18,FAlayn, 37 - who died on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
