OL,3,GNEWSAShoreham sea deaths shock town's
OL,4,Aclose-knit community
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday it was confirmed that
OL,7,Fsix-year-old Saja El-Khawas, the sister
OL,8,Fof Sara and daughter of Hassan and
OL,9,FZeina, had died in hospital.
OL,11,FPolice say the family - British
OL,12,Fcitizens of Palestinian origin,
OL,13,Faccording to The Palestinian Forum -
OL,14,Fare believed to have gone into the
OL,15,Fwater near Shoreham Fort in West
OL,16,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
